## تطبيق المبرمج عبر الإنترنت وهو مدير سيرورة قابل للتعديل التأثير بالبريد الإلكتروني على Web👨‍💻💻

#ifndef PAIIGN

#define PAIIGN

#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

struct Task {
    string name;
    int priority;
    bool isDone;
};

void displayTasks(const vector<Task>& tasks) {
    for (int i = 0; i < tasks.size(); ++i) {
        cout << "[" << i << "] " << tasks[i].name << " (Priority: " << tasks[i].priority << ", Done: " << (tasks[i].isDone ? "✓" : "✗") << ")" << endl;
    }
}

void addTask(vector<Task>& tasks, const string& name, int priority) {
    if (tasks.empty()) {
        tasks.push_back({name, priority, false});
    } else {
        // Add task to end
        tasks.push_back({name, priority, false});
    }
}

void removeTask(vector<Task>& tasks, int index) {
    if (index >= 0 && index < tasks.size()) {
        tasks.erase(tasks.begin() + index);
    }
}

void clearTasks(vector<Task>& tasks) {
    tasks.clear();
}

void saveTasksToFile(const vector<Task>& tasks, const string& filename) {
    ofstream file(filename);
    if (!file.is_open()) {
        cerr << "Failed to open file for writing." << endl;
        return;
    }

    for (const auto& task : tasks) {
        file << task.name << "\n";
        file << to_string(task.priority) << "\n";
        file << (task.isDone ? "1" : "0") << "\n";
    }
    file.close();
}

vector<Task> loadTasksFromFile(const string& filename) {
    vector<Task> tasks;
    ifstream file(filename);
    if (!file.is_open()) {
        cerr << "Failed to open file for reading." << endl;
        return tasks;
    }

    string line;
    while (getline(file, line)) {
        int priority;
        string name;
        char doneChar;
        size_t pos = line.find('=');
        if (pos == string::npos) {
            continue;
        }

        name = line.substr(0, pos);
        doneChar = line[pos + 1];
        priority = stoi(line.substr(pos + 2));

        tasks.push_back({name, priority, (doneChar == '1') ? true : false});
    }

    return tasks;
}

int main() {
    vector<Task> tasks;
    int choice;
    while (true) {
        cout << "1. Display Tasks\n2. Add Task\n3. Remove Task\n4. Clear All Tasks\n5. Save Tasks to File\n6. Load Tasks from File\n7. Exit\n";
        cin >> choice;
        switch (choice) {
            case 1:
                displayTasks(tasks);
                break;
            case 2:
                cout << "Enter task name: ";
                cin >> name;
                cout << "Enter priority (1-10): ";
                cin >> priority;
                addTask(tasks, name, priority);
                break;
            case 3:
                cout << "Enter task index to remove: ";
                cin >> index;
                removeTask(tasks, index);
                break;
            case 4:
                clearTasks(tasks);
                cout << "All tasks cleared.\n";
                break;
            case 5:
                cout << "Enter filename to save: ";
                cin >> filename;
                saveTasksToFile(tasks, filename);
                break;
            case 6:
                cout << "Enter filename to load: ";
                cin >> filename;
                tasks = loadTasksFromFile(filename);
                break;
            case 7:
                exit(0);
                break;
            default:
                cout << "Invalid option. Please try again.\n";
        }
    }
    return 0;
}

#endif

